---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - MyLifeCarePlanning.com"
  description="Privacy Policy for MyLifeCarePlanning.com. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your information."
  canonical="https://www.mylifecareplanning.com/privacy-policy/"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="bg-brand-900 text-white">
      <div class="page-container py-10">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-3">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/10 text-brand-200 text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Effective Date: August 1, 2026</span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-white/10 text-brand-200 text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Version 1.1</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="page-container section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="space-y-10 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">1</span>
              Overview and ICHCC Non-Affiliation
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">MyLifeCarePlanning.com is a national directory of life care planning professionals operated by MyLifeCarePlanning.com. MyLifeCarePlanning.com is an independent technology entity and is <strong>not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by</strong> the International Commission on Health Care Certification (ICHCC).</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">2</span>
              Categories and Sources of Information
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">We collect identifiers including names and professional titles. This data is primarily sourced from publicly available records and professional registries. We also collect technical data (IP address, browser type) via cookies to monitor site performance.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">3</span>
              Data Use and Third Parties
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">Information is used solely to facilitate the directory. We share data with essential service providers including hosting, email, and analytics providers. We do not collect medical records or Protected Health Information (PHI). This site is not directed to individuals under the age of 16.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">4</span>
              Data Retention and User Rights
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">We retain inquiry data and technical logs for 3 years. Professional listing data is retained until a removal request is processed. You have the right to access, correct, or delete your information by emailing <a href="mailto:info@mylifecareplanning.com" class="text-brand-700 font-medium hover:underline">info@mylifecareplanning.com</a>.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">5</span>
              Professional Opt-Out Rights
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">Any listed life care planner may request the removal of their business contact information. Once verified, these details are moved to a <strong>Permanent Suppression List</strong> to prevent restoration during future data imports.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">6</span>
              Cookie Consent
            </h2>
            <p class="pl-8">By using this site, you consent to the use of cookies. You may manage these through your browser settings, though some directory features may be limited if cookies are disabled.</p>
          </section>

          <div class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-6">
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">For questions about this policy, contact <a href="mailto:info@mylifecareplanning.com" class="text-brand-700 hover:underline">info@mylifecareplanning.com</a>.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
